### 优惠券接口使用的登录凭证
# @name couponLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"12345678"}

###

### 运营创建满减券模板（金额单位：分）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/coupon-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{couponLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "满50减10",
  "threshold_cent": 5000,
  "discount_cent": 1000,
  "total_count": 100,
  "starts_at": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z",
  "ends_at": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### 运营查看券模板列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/coupon-templates?page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{couponLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###

### 运营下架券模板
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/coupon-templates/1
Authorization: Bearer {{couponLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "inactive"
}

###

### 用户领取优惠券（重复领取返回 409；已下架返回 409）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/coupons/1/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{couponLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###

### 我的券列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/coupons
Authorization: Bearer {{couponLogin.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###
